1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,997
A man lay in a sealed room for four days.

2
00:00:03,017 --> 00:00:07,680
He could not see, hear, taste, smell, or
feel anything.

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,422
Then he began to hear his dead wife.

4
00:00:10,442 --> 00:00:12,970
Why did the scientists keep listening?

5
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:14,615
What did they want from him?

6
00:00:14,635 --> 00:00:16,398
Let us go back to the beginning.

7
00:00:16,998 --> 00:00:22,499
In nineteen eighty-three, a group of
deeply religious scientists

8
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:26,681
ran a secret test in an undisclosed
facility.

9
00:00:26,701 --> 00:00:31,538
They believed the five senses clouded our
view of eternity.

10
00:00:31,558 --> 00:00:37,956
Take them away, they thought, and a human
mind could reach God by thought alone.

11
00:00:37,976 --> 00:00:43,403
They chose an elderly man who said he had
nothing left to live for.

12
00:00:43,423 --> 00:00:44,804
He volunteered.

13
00:00:44,824 --> 00:00:51,198
Surgeons cut every nerve that carried
feeling from his body to his brain.

14
00:00:51,218 --> 00:00:58,012
His muscles still worked, but he could no
longer see, hear, taste, smell, or feel.

15
00:00:58,612 --> 00:01:01,761
Nothing reached him from the outside
world.

16
00:01:01,781 --> 00:01:05,112
The scientists watched through the glass,
and

17
00:01:05,132 --> 00:01:08,465
a tape recorder caught his slurred words.

18
00:01:08,485 --> 00:01:10,818
He could not hear himself speak.

19
00:01:10,838 --> 00:01:17,627
After four days, he said hushed, unclear
voices were speaking inside his head.

20
00:01:17,647 --> 00:01:22,986
The scientists assumed he was sliding into
psychosis, a serious

21
00:01:23,006 --> 00:01:27,600
break from reality, so they paid him
little attention.

22
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:31,870
Two days later, he said his dead wife was
talking

23
00:01:31,890 --> 00:01:34,957
to him, and that he could answer her.

24
00:01:34,977 --> 00:01:39,574
Then he began naming dead relatives of the
scientists.

25
00:01:39,594 --> 00:01:42,734
He repeated private details that only
their

26
00:01:42,754 --> 00:01:45,754
spouses and parents could have known.

27
00:01:45,774 --> 00:01:48,068
Some of them walked out of the study.

28
00:01:48,668 --> 00:01:52,831
For a week, the voices filled every waking
moment.

29
00:01:52,851 --> 00:01:58,445
He threw his body against the wall, hoping
for pain to drown them out.

30
00:01:58,465 --> 00:02:02,785
He begged for sedatives, so he could
escape by sleeping.

31
00:02:02,805 --> 00:02:07,379
Sleep brought nightmares, and in them, the
dead were waiting.

32
00:02:07,979 --> 00:02:10,215
Then the voices turned hostile.

33
00:02:10,235 --> 00:02:13,382
They spoke of hell and the end of the
world.

34
00:02:13,402 --> 00:02:16,994
For five hours, he shouted the same words.

35
00:02:17,014 --> 00:02:19,147
"No heaven. No forgiveness."

36
00:02:19,167 --> 00:02:22,893
The scientists were certain he was close
to God.

37
00:02:22,913 --> 00:02:25,910
Soon he could no longer form a sentence.

38
00:02:25,930 --> 00:02:29,524
He lost control of his body, and the team
had

39
00:02:29,544 --> 00:02:33,438
to tie him down so he could not harm
himself.

40
00:02:33,458 --> 00:02:37,810
Later he went still, tears running
silently down his

41
00:02:37,830 --> 00:02:41,781
face, and they kept him hydrated for two
weeks.

42
00:02:42,381 --> 00:02:46,547
At last, though he was blind, he turned
his head and

43
00:02:46,567 --> 00:02:50,872
looked straight at a scientist for the
first time.

44
00:02:50,892 --> 00:02:56,141
He whispered that he had spoken with God,
and God had abandoned them.

45
00:02:56,161 --> 00:02:58,554
Then his vital signs stopped.

46
00:02:58,574 --> 00:03:01,574
No cause of death was ever found.

47
00:03:01,594 --> 00:03:05,952
This video is inspired by the story
Gateway of the

48
00:03:05,972 --> 00:03:10,780
Mind, as published on an online horror
story page.

49
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,001
Now tell me.

50
00:03:12,021 --> 00:03:14,488
Would you have kept listening to the
voices?

